    <summary>Cross-platform terminal Pokédex powered by PokeAPI.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[poke is a cross-platform terminal Pokédex powered by PokeAPI. Browse with a keyboard-first TUI, or look up stats and evolution chains from the command line. The pokedex command is an equivalent alias.]]></description>
    <tags>pokemon pokedex pokeapi cli tui terminal</tags>
